Open Vanilla mangos 0012 — the world server's settings and log lines say Open Vanilla.

* mangosd.conf: every setting may be written OpenVanilla.X (OpenVanilla.Transmog = 1,
  OpenVanilla.Warfront.BotFill.Hours = 2-14, ...). Config::Reload also stores such a line under the
  OpenVanilla.X name the code reads, and the new spelling wins over an old-name line, so existing
  configs keep working unchanged and nothing that reads a setting had to change.
  (Tested: realm/mangos/tests/config_names.cpp against this Config.cpp.)
* Log lines: "Open Vanilla gameplay: ...", "Open Vanilla Warfront: ...", "Open Vanilla: ...".
* Applies after 0011. Source paths (src/game/OpenVanilla/) keep their names.

